  "goodToKnow": "Variabel means variable or flexible: variable Arbeitszeiten, ein variabler Zinssatz (variable interest rate), variable Kosten. Like dunkel and teuer, it drops its e with endings: variable, not variabele. Die Variable is a variable in maths or programming. The verb variieren means to vary. Note the pronunciation: va-RYAA-bel, not like English. Synonyms: flexibel, veränderlich."
